{"c":[{"name":"20260919T193745Z-b26ffd587de72a56","text":"Router backs off RouterConfig.failure_backoff_seconds (10s) after a failed evaluation; router tests advance a fake clock rather than expecting an immediate retry. Provider presets patch their own module's post_json in tests.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T193825Z-36390ce7b0d562a4","text":"Caret last-N sends Bearer plus X-Screenpipe-Client: api; token from SCREENPIPE_LOCAL_API_KEY, SCREENPIPE_API_KEY, or pinned screenpipe auth token.","type":"note"}]}
